      "statement": "The main-agent LangGraph recursion_limit is set twice: create_deep_agent applies .with_config with recursion_limit 9_999 on the compiled graph, but the dcode product re-wraps that agent with a second .with_config setting the resolved effective limit, so the product value overrides the SDK's 9,999.",
