      "id": "claim_955e5ae832d34b9b9e79cc5fe080f4c9",
      "statement": "Cost coverage is not limited to the agent's own model node: a process-wide _SessionCostRecorder collects one record per completed model request keyed by thread — including offload/summarization, the Auto-mode classifier, and subagent graph calls made outside after_model — so the 'one model call per turn' assumption does not hold for cost/latency accounting.",
